{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "7bd5d74e73f9d68e2a2abc93fa2b06831ae9e36be32fa8b8fad53e6e1080fd78", "ja": "ココはドコ？　ワタシは……姫？", "zh": "这里是哪里？我……是公主？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "831a6fbba7533db9bedd2510af0f1f2545e69156d659e1e01cb6d69ba49e82a1", "ja": "次の天体公演が開催決定。プロデューサーは\n美也、まつり、未来をメンバーに選ぶ。打ち\n合わせの日、外で野球中の昴がホームランを\n打った時、一瞬の閃光が辺りを包む。そして\nやってきたまつりは、記憶を失っていた……", "zh": "下一场天体公演确定举办。制作人选定美也、まつり和未来作为成员。商讨的那天，正在外面打棒球的昴击出全垒打时，一瞬间的闪光笼罩了四周。随后到来的まつり，失去了记忆……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "782ba8c775d4cbe00575700968e594ba6e88e9c81a467783f20b7376df6f8784", "ja": "（次の天体公演に向けて、美也、まつり、未来と\nミーティングをする事になったのだが……）", "zh": "（本来要和美也、茉莉、未来一起为下一场天体公演开会的，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_01_1001_042miy", "source_sha256": "dcc1bed9ddcaab80a937e4a5cd869bd43a1e6275e3566bab1f5f9c3009895e09", "ja": "……はふぅ、五臓六腑に染みますなあ～。\n美味しいココアで、体がポカポカです～。", "zh": "……哈～，真是沁人心脾呢～。\n喝了美味的热可可，身体变得暖洋洋的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_01_1002_042miy", "source_sha256": "224716cfbc7385dad1d60221a4b0ea1d156352df1bed27e4c683cf73a498eea5", "ja": "{$P$}さんも、どうぞ～。\n甘くて、とってもおいしいですよ～。", "zh": "{$P$}先生也请用吧～。\n甜甜的，非常好喝哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_01_1003_p", "source_sha256": "05d885bafb26f19f4d2831d2936a86616760f9f12123d11f92e416d1f58e2c2d", "ja": "ああ、ありがとう。いただきます。", "zh": "啊，谢谢。我就不客气了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_01_1004_p", "source_sha256": "0628e55096fbe74247729f8d6bd51ecd273cb22f97c57381e6ce3f983939b6f2", "ja": "（時間を間違えた美也が、早めに劇場に来たので、\nココアを飲みながら、ふたりを待つ事にした）", "zh": "（美也记错了时间，早早来到了剧场，所以我决定一边喝可可，一边等她们两个。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_01_1005_se", "source_sha256": "9d9e66fd95e409a1dd1ed9c3ced47f1dc289cbf09abfd49318d6be74f117de59", "ja": "カキーン！", "zh": "锵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_01_1006_029umi", "source_sha256": "402c6cf69f98b0fbf2817bab67009bb2933eaaac8d07004c371a087848709690", "ja": "わぁ～！？　すごいすごいっ、高いっ！", "zh": "哇～！？好厉害好厉害，好高啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_01_1007_047sub", "source_sha256": "0cb118afd41514baf17392b68ad8238e8b38788135d7fd332ed4fd263181dd39", "ja": "あー、フライかー……。\nよーし！　次こそホームランだー！", "zh": "啊——，是高飞球啊……\n好——！下次一定要打出本垒打——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_01_1008_040tam", "source_sha256": "908f0fb1608a15e7800c01562eae8e7eb48f1989a6895bf7ab7ed21e698eb1da", "ja": "がんばれ～！", "zh": "加油～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_01_1009_p", "source_sha256": "79320219b9dcb099cb24ff7ed8e3a98f8ca1cf2afc786e8bd7f2a1a58d2a6735", "ja": "外がにぎやかだな。あの声は……昴と海美と環か。\nこんな寒いのに外で野球とは、3人とも元気だな……。", "zh": "外面真热闹啊。那个声音是……昴、海美和环吗？\n这么冷的天还在外面打棒球，3个人都真有精神啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_01_1010_042miy", "source_sha256": "7e8e058c7e7cc42f7da7208a3dd5d1921cd8e46287be7d379849f56b66989fff", "ja": "おや～？　これは、『月刊メー』の最新号ですね～。\n{$P$}さん、読んでもいいですか～？", "zh": "哎呀～？这是《{$P$}先生》的最新一期呢～。\n我可以读吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_01_1011_p", "source_sha256": "bd7ea1b53c2b73cac5f592a74515e91fb17df581281724b0e447a08548e52343", "ja": "ああ、構わないよ。今月号は、\n雪歩のインタビューが載ってるんだ。", "zh": "啊，没关系。这个月刊登了雪步的采访。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_01_1012_042miy", "source_sha256": "beda4ed180a3622605bbe8d2269025a2fede847b2b7f7709fca3b81fedb90a0a", "ja": "お～。雪歩さんが、UFOに遭遇した話ですか～。\nなかなか興味深いですな～。", "zh": "哦～是雪步小姐遇到UFO的故事吗～？还真是挺有意思的呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_01_1013_p", "source_sha256": "1d5d9aa83f6ef64543f2973b0847043b5dbf7e4cda278ed14f65815691f615b3", "ja": "（未来とまつりを待っている間、雑誌を読んでいると、\n美也の手がセンターページで止まった）", "zh": "（等待未来和茉莉的时候，我一边看着杂志，美也的手在中央跨页上停了下来）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_01_1014_042miy", "source_sha256": "19ebcb987f21da713bf9b349b8ae5b93b92cedcbae72737969a78bd88c9a89b7", "ja": "おや～？　地球に、隕石が接近しているんですね～。\n衝突する日は……なんと、今日だそうですよ～。", "zh": "哦～？陨石正在接近地球呢～。\n据说撞上的日子……居然就是今天哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_01_1015_p", "source_sha256": "5e9c506375b91e3d75531fbf7d2998a4bfac432444ff38a60f50837d7e81e3d8", "ja": "えっ！？　隕石が衝突するだって？\nあはは、そんなまさか……。", "zh": "诶！？陨石要撞上地球了？  \n啊哈哈，怎么可能……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_01_1016_047sub", "source_sha256": "81ebeccc7d85ece366c94d7ff74ac241ef06541d76d2e0da72c4cd71fd3ba024", "ja": "いけー！　ホームラーーーン！！", "zh": "上啊——！本垒打——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_01_1017_se", "source_sha256": "db488c2e4e3e1f2394399cbbb9fb4b72cbb00759b77d4134e0b0e28b28e337dd", "ja": "カアアァァァーン！！", "zh": "锵锵锵锵！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_01_1018_p", "source_sha256": "5bcb7e762e0fb5e004e028d9aea3395070da78fcaa88dc5bbd0088b22a2afcd4", "ja": "！？　今、空が光って……いや、気のせいか。\n昴がホームランを打っただけだよな。うん。", "zh": "！？刚才天空是不是亮了一下……不，应该是我看错了。\n只是昴打出了全垒打而已吧。嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_01_1019_042miy", "source_sha256": "75bc70dfabae50cdd3f4f42616c8aa79da9a85f1f4acbe6b8ec741e5425b254c", "ja": "でも、すごい音でしたね～。もしかしたら\n本当に、隕石が落ちたのかもしれませんよ～。", "zh": "不过，刚才的声音真大啊～。说不定真的有陨石掉下来了呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_01_1020_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_01_1022_p", "source_sha256": "80b76847a8c9922aeea2c27de99bdc016be5cd1d77bea2d820e3ec8a190be006", "ja": "あ、まつり。\nお疲れさま。", "zh": "啊，茉莉。\n辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_01_1024_p", "source_sha256": "a7e80e7c1d3d91774f0b16d72b6575a7d379698473277b0950642fcbb3dd72a0", "ja": "まつり？　……どうかしたのか？", "zh": "茉莉？怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_01_1025_014mir", "source_sha256": "f6dca5ab3d71263b97da266dfdd1167020a928348a1d2e9638ad408c64c65b8c", "ja": "お疲れ様でーすっ！　うう～、寒いーっ！\nあっ、美也ちゃんだ！　もう来てたんだね♪", "zh": "辛苦啦——！呜呜～，好冷——！\n啊，美也！你已经来啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_01_1026_042miy", "source_sha256": "5a0587d73024f70488f3562be59bddb349406b43172f9af573f60b7449b7d20b", "ja": "はい～。時間を間違えて、早く来てしまいました～。\n未来ちゃんは、まつりちゃんと一緒だったんですか～？", "zh": "是～。我弄错时间，不小心来早了～。未来刚才是和茉莉一起的吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_01_1027_014mir", "source_sha256": "c05c0849f7cc44e6d5d06e58c5bc64a4918eb94a5d2026eac1e904eecc5173d8", "ja": "うん！　さっき入り口で、バッタリ会ったんだ！\nそうだよね、まつりちゃん？", "zh": "嗯！刚才在入口碰巧遇到的！\n对吧，茉莉？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_01_1028_021mat", "source_sha256": "6c0f5705b2ee225ee33146011918ca3c041795743d6312aa9408dbbbee99ab2f", "ja": "えっ？　……ええと……。", "zh": "诶？……那个……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_01_1029_p", "source_sha256": "7fdd039b7a68641f838cc732aa48f1e9b6bdfda4b3234532c1462f14524d796f", "ja": "寒かっただろ、ふたりとも。ココア飲むか？\n青羽さんに用意してもらったんだ。", "zh": "你们两个，很冷吧？要喝热可可吗？\n是青羽小姐帮忙准备的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_01_1030_014mir", "source_sha256": "622666c9e1afafea7f0660c1bfbd0c87106fef3892239a6de36d8531feea108b", "ja": "わーい、ココア大好きー！\nいただきまーす♪", "zh": "哇——我最喜欢热可可了——！\n那我开动啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_01_1031_042miy", "source_sha256": "297feee7fbadbed86959f62fa44a19034d07036d430f243b771176e609ef5404", "ja": "まつりちゃんも、どうぞ～。\nマシュマロを乗せると、美味しいですよ～。", "zh": "小茉莉，你也请吧～  \n放上棉花糖会很好吃哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_01_1032_021mat", "source_sha256": "3faa7a0d5e91614c76ca6fbc7e91ee33e8db5e85b472f79ecf861a3e5d3f7a49", "ja": "あ、ありがとう。\nでも、私……マシュマロは苦手なんだ。", "zh": "啊，谢谢。\n不过，我……不太喜欢棉花糖。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_01_1033_014mir", "source_sha256": "3e30faa80de01e9852eb3ab74c01218d43a418628c8b693aac39ccead8429b15", "ja": "ええっ！？", "zh": "咦咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_01_1034_042miy", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_01_1035_014mir", "source_sha256": "84fdfb0b146766826c005a93df8cf3bd6d34a6655019a51d16ab334b5bf4cdde", "ja": "まつりちゃん、何言ってるの！？\n配る用のマシュマロ、いつも持ってるよね？", "zh": "茉莉，你在说什么呀！？\n用来分给大家的棉花糖，平时不是都随身带着吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_01_1036_042miy", "source_sha256": "14f9e7084811e63bf4ad4f788a7820d6ca72d350ab4fddba2d5f7deeabaeaebc", "ja": "そうですよ～。それに、まつりちゃんのプロフィールに\nちゃーんと書いてありますよ～。好きなものって……。", "zh": "是啊～而且，公主殿下的个人资料里也写得清清楚楚哦～喜欢的东西是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_01_1037_021mat", "source_sha256": "1ca20eac456a07dbe63551fdae4a40f970a294417da617f03b20bfb3902db54a", "ja": "プロフィール？　何の……？\nごめんなさい。私、ちょっとわからなくて……。", "zh": "个人资料？什么的……？\n对不起，我有点不明白……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_01_1038_p", "source_sha256": "ae4d43d4866ff48c5dfa731605f05c82b064710d926ef3cc8c3a5dcfb632854c", "ja": "まつり、どうしたんだ？　何かあったのか？", "zh": "祭典，怎么了？发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_01_1039_021mat", "source_sha256": "a7ebd67e66a3158b3c674f800c0e123679208fb324eeae8292b7aea25690c038", "ja": "えっと……忘れちゃった、のかな？\nあの……あなたたちは、誰ですか？", "zh": "那个……是忘记了吗？\n那个……你们是谁？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_01_1040_014mir", "source_sha256": "a089bf2cf4bd686bb7c10b2393f4f49afcaaa801199b9174b4a7700d51292a01", "ja": "えーっ！？　私だよ、まつりちゃん！\n未来……春日未来だよ！　どうしちゃったのー！？", "zh": "诶——！？是我呀，茉莉！  \n未来……我是春日未来呀！你这是怎么了——！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_01_1041_042miy", "source_sha256": "e3eb47871b55e38cb658ccde135a7d41452b3dacdf8cee1f7d6fda4d38d4af39", "ja": "私は、宮尾美也と申します～。\n初めまして……になるんでしょうか～？", "zh": "我叫宫尾美也～。\n我们算是……初次见面吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_01_1042_p", "source_sha256": "b2e854948f473bf04fc13707838923d7be3836648a8154de9bf79670b180c416", "ja": "そして俺は、この劇場のプロデューサーだけど……\nまつり、冗談はそろそろ……。", "zh": "而我是这家剧场的制作人，不过……\n小祭，玩笑也该适可而止了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_01_1043_021mat", "source_sha256": "447aec4f68b5741da0c25c91bb8fbce64ee58f87788b49f3a0e7185328937e04", "ja": "未来ちゃんに、美也ちゃんに、\n{$P$}さんだね。うん、覚えたよ。", "zh": "未来妹妹、美也妹妹，还有{$P$}先生对吧。嗯，我记住了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_01_1046_021mat", "source_sha256": "9f54ff8c30a200de1c4e2cb22072b21021e66c70bd4dd094c64362a096060505", "ja": "あっ、私も自己紹介しなきゃ。\n私は……あれ？　私、誰なんだろう……？", "zh": "啊，我也得做自我介绍才行。\n我是……咦？我，到底是谁呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_01_1047_p", "source_sha256": "ea67e4b6256b9a471864a97a84a293b6a17984b2bd4251d6a942b53d50f17db6", "ja": "君の名前は、徳川まつり。\nこの劇場に所属している、アイドルだよ。", "zh": "你的名字是德川茉莉。\n是属于这座剧场的偶像哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_01_1048_021mat", "source_sha256": "a1205510c56be61dea114cdfc2e5740a865c736ebaaa21c9b07ee75f16634a5d", "ja": "徳川まつり……この劇場の、アイドル？\n……そう。私、アイドルなんだ。そう……。", "zh": "德川茉莉……这家剧场的，偶像？\n……这样啊。我是偶像啊。这样啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_01_1049_021mat", "source_sha256": "d6850feb1dac8e51d3911461a06aadc96538a1b8374873725db6bc1a4cbd8604", "ja": "それで……私は今日、どうしてここに来たんだろう？\nもしかして、アイドルのお仕事があるのかな。", "zh": "所以……我今天为什么会来到这里呢？\n难道是有偶像的工作吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_01_1050_p", "source_sha256": "7607ccd5f6d23299fcab88739fc96c14127f21f4d88d6c91490cb8088d6c3f55", "ja": "あ、ああ。そうなんだ。　新しい公演で、\nユニットを組んでもらう事になったんだ。", "zh": "啊、啊啊。是这样。我们安排你们在新的公演中组成一个组合。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_01_1051_042miy", "source_sha256": "0ab30829b058af4b79e85bf6ac7c3533cb97222aa43bffe826f8ceb998501451", "ja": "おお、そうでした～。今日のミーティングは、\n新しいお仕事のお話なんですよね～？", "zh": "哦哦，原来是这样～今天的会议，是要聊新工作的事情吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_01_1052_021mat", "source_sha256": "ae2c7e6b71e4d3be46f0bf78559a86d2da0f24e92205c92d9ead2ca3fd34ad55", "ja": "そう……。じゃあ{$P$}さん、\nそのお話、始めてください。", "zh": "对……那么{$P$}先生，请开始说这件事吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_01_1053_p", "source_sha256": "96fb95fd6292d5d584b1500a35a37efde05be13458baf7887a5435afa20faf57", "ja": "あ、ああ。次の天体公演は、この3人でと思って……\nユニット名は『タウラス』。おうし座という意味だ。", "zh": "啊、啊。下次的天体公演，我想就由这3个人参加……  \n组合名是『金牛座』，意思就是金牛座。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_01_1054_p", "source_sha256": "2e865928b0254cb7e06ae10beb4a7a1427772fcc56bcd92f43dfa08574102de2", "ja": "ただ今回は、コンセプトも曲も何も決まってないんだ。\nだから、これからみんなで考えていこうと思って……。", "zh": "不过这次，无论是主题还是歌曲，都还什么都没定下来。\n所以，我想接下来和大家一起想……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_01_1055_014mir", "source_sha256": "3eae79b0fdfe5a8153599ba9938108850d73332e21a6a024ba51d8b730e2b84b", "ja": "ええっ！？　いいんですか！\nみんなで考えていいなんて、すっごく楽しそう！", "zh": "诶！？真的可以吗！\n能和大家一起思考，感觉好有意思！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_01_1056_042miy", "source_sha256": "59bf7921d345a8087e55cdbb5b8f46e7b863fd9307a9c6fdd93250125ef0dd63", "ja": "はい～。とっても、面白そうなユニットですね～。\n腕が鳴りますな～、むふふ。", "zh": "是呀～。感觉是个非常有趣的组合呢～。\n真是让人跃跃欲试啊～，呜呼呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_01_1057_021mat", "source_sha256": "6c0f44a559eaae4fccffa3df7c1b36dc037f07055f47af9b914082c5298d463c", "ja": "天体公演……ユニット？\nふむふむ……。", "zh": "天体公演……组合？\n嗯哼嗯哼……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_01_1058_p", "source_sha256": "b1f43002927be89df9768ea0c0091df180b5e1a5196444c998dbf97f8b701c19", "ja": "（まつりは神妙な様子で、ミーティングを聞いている。\n冗談なのか？　それとも……？）", "zh": "（小祭一脸凝重地听着会议内容。是开玩笑吗？还是说……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
